1. Description

    Enhanced the medicine product detail page to provide customers with complete and clearly organized product information before purchasing.

    The product detail experience was improved by refining the product image presentation, medicine information hierarchy, pricing, availability, quantity selection, purchase actions, and supporting product information.

    The objective was to make the product page more informative, trustworthy, and easy to use while maintaining consistency with the overall Pharma Store design.

2. Business Requirement

    Customers need sufficient information about a medicine or healthcare product before adding it to their cart.

    The product detail page should allow users to:

    View the product clearly.
    Understand the medicine/product name.
    View pricing and discounts.
    Check availability.
    Review important product information.
    Select the required quantity.
    Add the product to the cart.
    Continue shopping or proceed toward purchase.

    The page also needs to work consistently across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

3. Features Implemented
    Product Information

     Enhanced the product information section to display:

      Product name
      Product category
      Product image
      Price
      Discount information
      Availability
      Product description
      Product specifications
      Relevant healthcare information
      Purchase options

4. Product Image Gallery

    Improved product image presentation by implementing a structured product media area.

     The product image section supports:

     High-resolution product image.
     Consistent image dimensions.
     Proper image scaling.
     Clean product background.
     Thumbnail/secondary images where available.
     Responsive image presentation.

     Example:

     ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
     │                                  │
     │                                  │
     │          PRODUCT IMAGE           │
     │                                  │
     │                                  │
     └──────────────────────────────────┘

     [ IMG 1 ] [ IMG 2 ] [ IMG 3 ]

     This provides customers with a clearer view of the medicine or healthcare product.

5. Product Pricing

    Improved pricing presentation to make the purchase cost immediately visible.

    Example:

     ₹499
     ₹399

     20% OFF

     Where applicable, the page displays:

     Original price
     Current price
     Discount amount
     Discount percentage
     Promotional pricing

     The pricing hierarchy was designed to make the current selling price visually prominent.

6. Product Availability

    Added clear availability information.

    Example:

    ✓ In Stock

    or

    Limited Stock

    or

    Out of Stock

    This allows customers to understand product availability before attempting to purchase.

7. Quantity Selection

     Implemented a quantity selector to allow customers to specify how many units they want to purchase.

     Example:

     [-]   1   [+]

     The quantity control was designed with clear buttons and appropriate spacing for desktop and mobile users.

8. Add to Cart

    Enhanced the primary purchase action with a clearly visible:

    [ Add to Cart ]

     button.

     The button was positioned prominently near the product pricing and quantity controls so that customers can quickly complete the product-selection step.

9. Product Description

    Improved the product description section to provide structured information about the product.

    Information can include:

    Product overview
    Usage information
    Key characteristics
    Product contents
    Available quantity
    Packaging information

    The content hierarchy was improved so users can scan the information easily.

10. Product Specifications

     Added a structured specifications area for relevant product attributes.

     Example:

    Attribute	Details
    Product Type	Medicine
    Category	Healthcare
    Pack Size	As listed
    Availability	In Stock
    Manufacturer	As configured
    Prescription	As applicable

    This makes product information easier to understand and compare.

