14. Responsive Design

     The product detail page was optimized for different devices.

      Desktop
      ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
      │                                                        │
      │       Product Image       │       Product Information  │
      │                           │                            │
      │                           │       Price                │
      │                           │       Availability         │
      │                           │       Quantity              │
      │                           │       Add to Cart          │
      │                                                        │
      └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
      Mobile

      The layout changes to a vertically stacked structure:

      Product Image

      Product Name
 
      Price

      Availability

      Description

      Quantity

      [ Add to Cart ]

      This ensures that product information remains accessible without horizontal scrolling.

